    "Automatic safety checks stopped after three attempts. Restore your light in Settings, then turn “Keep logo on with lid closed” off and on to retry.": {
      "comment": "Backlit interface text. Keep product names and technical identifiers unchanged.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatic safety checks stopped after three attempts. Restore your light in Settings, then turn “Keep logo on with lid closed” off and on to retry."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las comprobaciones automáticas de seguridad se detuvieron tras tres intentos. Restaura la luz en Ajustes y luego desactiva y vuelve a activar «Mantener el logo encendido con la tapa cerrada» para reintentar."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les vérifications automatiques de sécurité se sont arrêtées après trois tentatives. Restaurez la lumière dans Réglages, puis désactivez et réactivez « Garder le logo allumé avec le capot fermé » pour réessayer."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatische Sicherheitsprüfungen nach drei Versuchen gestoppt. In den Einstellungen das Licht wiederherstellen, dann die Deckelbeleuchtung aus- und einschalten, um es erneut zu versuchen."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安全確認は3回の試行後に停止しました。設定でライトを復元し、「画面を閉じてもロゴを点灯」をオフにしてからオンにすると再試行できます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "안전 확인이 세 번 시도 후 중단되었습니다. 설정에서 조명을 복원한 다음 ‘덮개를 닫아도 로고 켜기’를 껐다 켜서 다시 시도하세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As verificações automáticas de segurança pararam após três tentativas. Restaure a luz em Ajustes e depois desative e reative “Manter logo aceso com a tampa fechada” para tentar novamente."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动安全检查已在三次尝试后停止。请在设置中恢复灯光，然后关闭并重新开启“合盖时保持徽标亮起”以重试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自動安全檢查已在三次嘗試後停止。請在設定中恢復燈光，然後關閉並重新開啓“合蓋時保持徽標亮起”以重試。"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "การตรวจความปลอดภัยอัตโนมัติหยุดหลังลองสามครั้ง กู้คืนไฟในการตั้งค่า แล้วปิดและเปิด “เปิดโลโก้ค้างไว้เมื่อปิดฝาจอ” เพื่อลองใหม่"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I controlli di sicurezza automatici si sono interrotti dopo tre tentativi. Ripristina la luce in Impostazioni, poi disattiva e riattiva «Mantieni acceso il logo a coperchio chiuso» per riprovare."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De automatische veiligheidscontroles zijn na drie pogingen gestopt. Herstel je licht in Instellingen en schakel ‘Houd logo aan bij gesloten deksel’ uit en weer in om het opnieuw te proberen."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatyczne kontrole bezpieczeństwa zatrzymały się po trzech próbach. Przywróć podświetlenie w ustawieniach, a następnie wyłącz i ponownie włącz opcję „Podświetlaj logo przy zamkniętej pokrywie”."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Otomatik güvenlik kontrolleri üç denemeden sonra durdu. Işığı Ayarlar’da geri yükleyin, ardından “Kapak kapalıyken logoyu açık tut” seçeneğini kapatıp açarak tekrar deneyin."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kiểm tra an toàn tự động đã dừng sau ba lần thử. Hãy khôi phục đèn trong Cài đặt, rồi tắt và bật lại “Giữ đèn logo sáng khi đóng nắp” để thử lại."
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pemeriksaan keselamatan otomatis berhenti setelah tiga percobaan. Pulihkan lampu di Pengaturan, lalu matikan dan nyalakan kembali “Biarkan logo menyala saat penutup tertutup” untuk mencoba lagi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
