    "If Backlit is already enabled there but access is still denied after an update, remove the old Backlit entry, add the installed Backlit app again, enable it, then reopen Backlit.": {
      "comment": "Backlit interface text. Keep product names and technical identifiers unchanged.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If Backlit is already enabled there but access is still denied after an update, remove the old Backlit entry, add the installed Backlit app again, enable it, then reopen Backlit."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si Backlit ya está activado allí pero se sigue denegando el acceso tras una actualización, elimina la entrada antigua, vuelve a añadir la app Backlit instalada, actívala y vuelve a abrir Backlit."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si Backlit y est déjà activé mais que l’accès reste refusé après une mise à jour, supprimez l’ancienne entrée, ajoutez à nouveau l’app Backlit installée, activez-la, puis rouvrez Backlit."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn Backlit dort bereits aktiviert ist, der Zugriff nach einem Update aber verweigert wird: alten Eintrag entfernen, die installierte Backlit-App erneut hinzufügen und aktivieren, dann Backlit neu öffnen."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "アップデート後、Backlitが有効になっていてもアクセスが拒否される場合は、古いBacklitの項目を削除し、インストール済みのアプリを再追加して有効にし、Backlitを開き直してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "업데이트 후 Backlit이 이미 활성화되어 있는데도 접근이 거부되면 이전 Backlit 항목을 제거하고 설치된 앱을 다시 추가한 뒤 활성화하고 Backlit을 다시 여세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se o Backlit já estiver ativado ali, mas o acesso continuar negado após uma atualização, remova a entrada antiga, adicione novamente o app Backlit instalado, ative-o e reabra o Backlit."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果更新后 Backlit 已启用但仍被拒绝访问，请移除旧的 Backlit 条目，重新添加已安装的 Backlit 应用并启用，然后重新打开 Backlit。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果更新後 Backlit 已啓用但仍被拒絕訪問，請移除舊的 Backlit 條目，重新添加已安裝的 Backlit 應用並啓用，然後重新打開 Backlit。"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "หากเปิดสิทธิ์ Backlit แล้วแต่ยังถูกปฏิเสธหลังอัปเดต ให้ลบรายการ Backlit เก่า เพิ่มแอป Backlit ที่ติดตั้งไว้อีกครั้ง เปิดสิทธิ์ แล้วเปิด Backlit ใหม่"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se Backlit è già autorizzato ma l’accesso resta negato dopo un aggiornamento, rimuovi la vecchia voce, aggiungi di nuovo l’app installata, autorizzala e riaprila."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Als Backlit daar al is ingeschakeld maar de toegang na een update nog steeds wordt geweigerd, verwijder dan de oude vermelding, voeg de geïnstalleerde app opnieuw toe, schakel deze in en open Backlit opnieuw."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jeśli Backlit jest już tam włączony, ale po aktualizacji nadal nie ma dostępu, usuń stary wpis Backlit, dodaj ponownie zainstalowaną aplikację, włącz dostęp i uruchom Backlit ponownie."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backlit burada zaten etkin olduğu hâlde güncellemeden sonra erişim reddediliyorsa eski Backlit kaydını kaldırın, yüklü uygulamayı yeniden ekleyip etkinleştirin ve Backlit’i yeniden açın."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nếu Backlit đã bật ở đó nhưng vẫn bị từ chối sau khi cập nhật, hãy xóa mục Backlit cũ, thêm lại ứng dụng Backlit đã cài đặt, bật quyền rồi mở lại Backlit."
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jika Backlit sudah diaktifkan di sana tetapi akses masih ditolak setelah pembaruan, hapus entri Backlit lama, tambahkan kembali app Backlit yang terinstal, aktifkan, lalu buka kembali Backlit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If access is off, allow Backlit in Privacy & Security → Screen & System Audio Recording.": {
      "comment": "Backlit interface text. Keep product names and technical identifiers unchanged.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If access is off, allow Backlit in Privacy & Security → Screen & System Audio Recording."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si no tiene acceso, autoriza Backlit en Privacidad y seguridad → Grabación de pantalla y audio del sistema."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si l’accès est désactivé, autorisez Backlit dans Confidentialité et sécurité → Enregistrement de l’écran et de l’audio système."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bei fehlendem Zugriff Backlit unter Datenschutz & Sicherheit → Bildschirm- und Systemaudioaufnahme erlauben."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "アクセスがオフの場合は「プライバシーとセキュリティ」→「画面収録とシステムオーディオ録音」でBacklitを許可してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "접근이 꺼져 있으면 개인정보 보호 및 보안 → 화면 및 시스템 오디오 녹음에서 Backlit을 허용하세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se o acesso estiver desativado, permita o Backlit em Privacidade e Segurança → Gravação da Tela e Áudio do Sistema."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "若访问权限关闭，请在“隐私与安全性”→“屏幕与系统音频录制”中允许 Backlit。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "若訪問權限關閉，請在“隱私與安全性”→“螢幕與系統音訊錄制”中允許 Backlit。"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "หากปิดสิทธิ์อยู่ ให้อนุญาต Backlit ในความเป็นส่วนตัวและความปลอดภัย → การบันทึกหน้าจอและเสียงระบบ"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se l’accesso è disattivato, autorizza Backlit in Privacy e sicurezza → Registrazione schermo e audio di sistema."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Als de toegang uitstaat, geef Backlit dan toegang bij Privacy en beveiliging → Scherm- en systeemaudio-opname."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jeśli dostęp jest wyłączony, zezwól aplikacji Backlit na dostęp w sekcji Prywatność i ochrona → Nagrywanie ekranu i dźwięku systemowego."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erişim kapalıysa Gizlilik ve Güvenlik → Ekran ve Sistem Sesi Kaydı bölümünde Backlit’e izin verin."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nếu chưa cấp quyền, hãy cho phép Backlit trong Quyền riêng tư & Bảo mật → Ghi màn hình và âm thanh hệ thống."
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jika akses mati, izinkan Backlit di Privasi & Keamanan → Perekaman Layar & Audio Sistem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In-app updates aren’t enabled for this build yet. A trusted update feed and signing key must be included by the publisher.": {
      "comment": "Backlit interface text. Keep product names and technical identifiers unchanged.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In-app updates aren’t enabled for this build yet. A trusted update feed and signing key must be included by the publisher."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las actualizaciones dentro de la app aún no están activadas en esta compilación. El editor debe incluir una fuente de actualizaciones de confianza y una clave de firma."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les mises à jour intégrées ne sont pas encore activées dans cette version. L’éditeur doit inclure un flux de mises à jour fiable et une clé de signature."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In-App-Updates sind in diesem Build noch nicht aktiviert. Der Herausgeber muss eine vertrauenswürdige Updatequelle und einen Signaturschlüssel einbinden."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このビルドではアプリ内アップデートはまだ有効ではありません。発行元が信頼できる更新フィードと署名キーを含める必要があります。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 빌드에서는 앱 내 업데이트가 아직 활성화되지 않았습니다. 배포자가 신뢰할 수 있는 업데이트 피드와 서명 키를 포함해야 합니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As atualizações no app ainda não estão ativadas nesta compilação. O publicador precisa incluir uma fonte de atualizações confiável e uma chave de assinatura."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此构建版本尚未启用应用内更新。发布者需提供可信的更新源和签名密钥。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此構建版本尚未啓用應用內更新。發佈者需提供可信的更新源和簽名金鑰。"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "บิลด์นี้ยังไม่เปิดอัปเดตในแอป ผู้เผยแพร่ต้องใส่ฟีดอัปเดตที่เชื่อถือได้และคีย์ลงนาม"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gli aggiornamenti nell’app non sono ancora attivi in questa versione. L’editore deve includere un feed di aggiornamento attendibile e una chiave di firma."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Updates binnen de app zijn nog niet ingeschakeld voor deze build. De uitgever moet een vertrouwde updatefeed en ondertekeningssleutel toevoegen."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aktualizacje w aplikacji nie są jeszcze włączone w tej wersji. Wydawca musi dołączyć zaufane źródło aktualizacji i klucz podpisu."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bu sürümde uygulama içi güncellemeler henüz açık değil. Yayıncı güvenilir bir güncelleme kaynağı ve imzalama anahtarı eklemelidir."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chưa bật cập nhật trong ứng dụng cho bản dựng này. Nhà phát hành phải cung cấp nguồn cập nhật tin cậy và khóa ký."
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pembaruan dalam app belum diaktifkan dalam versi ini. Penerbit harus menyertakan umpan pembaruan tepercaya dan kunci penandatanganan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
